/ Every mark sits in an 18 px slot (w-3), the size the chart draws a fix at.
ul class="grid grid-flow-col grid-cols-2 grid-rows-4 gap-x-2 gap-y-1 border-t border-rule pt-2 font-mono text-label text-quiet" aria-label="Legend"
  - SYMBOLS.each do |mark|
    li class="flex items-center gap-1"
      svg class="size-3 shrink-0 #{mark.color}" viewBox="0 0 18 18" aria-hidden="true"
        polygon points=TRIANGLE fill=fill(mark) stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray=dash(mark)
      = mark.label
  - LINES.each do |line|
    li class="flex items-center gap-1"
      span class="w-3 shrink-0 border-t-2 #{line.classes}" aria-hidden="true"
      = line.label
  li class="flex items-center gap-1"
    span class="flex w-3 shrink-0 justify-center" aria-hidden="true"
      span class="size-1.5 border border-quiet"
    | target on scope
